.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.creds/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/.local/
**/.agent-runtime/
**/.launcher-runtime/
**/.artifacts/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/tmp/
**/*.log
# Command-owned runtime logs. Depth-specific patterns intentionally preserve
# the public top-level `ai-commands/logs` command bundle.
/ai-commands/*/logs/
/ai-commands/*/*/logs/
/ai-commands/*/*/*/logs/
!ai-commands/system/logs/
**/events/sent/
**/output/
**/.secrets/
**/start.config
**/*.command.conf
**/*.conf
**/*.config
!**/*.example.config
!**/*.command-default.config
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Operational profiles are local and private. Only the sanitized example profile is publishable.
/ai-profile/example-profile/
/ai-profile/example-profile/**
/ai-profile/*/
!/ai-profile/example/

# Local Hermes benchmark artifacts and checkout-root working copy.
/notes/benchmarks/local-models/runs/
/models/expertise-extractor/probes/context-capacity/manifest.json
/recognizers/snow-removal-contract-recognizer.mjs

# Angular source is versioned. Generated dependencies/build output remain ignored globally.
